            \cf8 print\cf5 (\cf6 f"\cf4 \{\cf5 i\cf4 :\cf6 >4d\cf4 \}\cf6  | \cf4 \{\cf5 c\cf4 :\cf6 <6\cf4 \}\cf6  | \cf4 \{\cf5 a.item()\cf4 :\cf6 <13.6f\cf4 \}  \{\cf5 b.item()\cf4 :\cf6 <13.6f\cf4 \}  \{\cf5 probs[\cf7 0\cf5 ].item()\cf4 :\cf6 <16.6f\cf4 \}  \{\cf5 probs[\cf7 1\cf5 ].item()\cf4 :\cf6 <16.6f\cf4 \}\cf6 "\cf5 )\
        \cf8 print\cf5 ()\
